## Workspace note (empirical)
pnpm 11 does not materialize a workspace package's optionalDependencies into its
own node_modules in this repo: lockfile importer records @huggingface/transformers
+ onnxruntime-common, node_modules/.pnpm carries them (hoisted), but
packages/embedding/node_modules lacks the link — resolve() from the package anchor
fails. The guard therefore resolves the effective copy via the .pnpm store scan
fallback (same scope the runtime patch aliases into). Fail-open arm semantics mean
this never broke tests; the guard is the first consumer that cares.
